'''Golem''' (ゴーレム, ''Gōremu'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Golem
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 221.png
|money drop = 2,000円 - 7,900円
}}

==Enemy==
High health, moderate attack, range and overall high stats apart from his speed and knockback count. This enemy isn't much to be feared about despite his high stats, because every stage he appears in doesn't set him to high magnifications, apart from the [[Ranking Dojo]] stage of which you may not even encounter him at his full 600% magnification.

==Strategy==
Any units that can outrange him such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]], [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Li'l Nyandam]] and many more can stay safe out of his attack range. Alternatively the player can brute force him by using strong hitting units, [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack Cats]] or even [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Units with Long Distance]].

The [[Castle and Dragon and Cats|first stage]] he appears in he is basically a one hit punching bag being at 1%, there is no strategy to beating him in that stage. However for the other stages he is supported by other [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event|Castle & Dragon]] enemies which allows the player to use wave or long distance units to deal damage to him.

